User Personas and User Journey
1. User Persona 1 – Brian Kamau
Age: 20 years
Programme: Bachelor of Business Information Technology (BBIT)
Year of Study: 2nd Year
Goals
•	Register for courses quickly. 
•	Check examination results. 
•	View his fee statement. 
•	Receive important university announcements. 
Needs
•	A single platform for accessing student services. 
•	Simple course registration. 
•	Easy access to academic results and fee information. 
•	Notifications about important university activities. 
Pain Points
•	Has to use different systems or visit offices to access some services. 
•	Sometimes struggles to know whether course registration was successful. 
•	Delayed access to important academic information. 
Technology Habits
•	Uses a smartphone every day. 
•	Frequently uses mobile applications for communication, education, and online services. 
•	Prefers self-service applications rather than visiting offices. 
App Expectations
Brian expects the app to have:
•	Easy navigation. 
•	Course registration. 
•	Fee statements. 
•	Academic results. 
•	Notifications. 
•	A simple dashboard. 
