5. HCI/User-Centered Design Connection
These personas and journeys demonstrate that the student portal is designed around real user goals, needs, and pain points.
User Problem	Design  Response
Difficulty accessing services	Centralized mobile dashboard
	
Visiting offices for information	Digital self-service
Uncertainty about registration	Registration confirmation
Difficulty checking fees	Online fee statement
Missing important announcements	Push notifications
Complicated navigation	Simple and consistent interface
